{
  "category": "Imitation Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composi tion appears to be closer to a rock than a plant.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "If a tree branch shakes when there is no wind, it's a SUDOWOODO, not a tree. It hides from the rain.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "SUDOWOODO camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because the forelegs remain green throughout the year, the POKéMON is easily identified as a fake during the winter.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SUDOWOODO camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because the forelegs remain green throughout the year, the POKéMON is easily identified as a fake during the winter.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. But since its forelegs remain green throughout the year, it is easily identified as a fake in the winter.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears to be closer to a rock than a plant.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Despite appearing to be a tree, its body is closer to rocks and stones. It is very weak to water.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stands along paths pretending to be a tree. If it starts raining, it seems to disappear.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
