    {
      "text": "Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sudowoodo camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because its hands remain green throughout the year, the Pokémon is easily identified as a fake during the winter.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sudowoodo camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because its hands remain green throughout the year, the Pokémon is easily identified as a fake during the winter.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "To avoid attack, it mimics a tree. It will run off if splashed with water, which it hates.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Apparently, the larger the green parts of this Pokémon, the more collectors value it. It’s a particular favorite among elderly people.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s so popular with the elderly that there’s a magazine devoted to this Pokémon. Fans obsess over the particular length and angle of its arms.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The result of its holding the same pose all the time is arms that have become supple yet strong.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "If a tree branch shakes when there is no wind, it’s a Sudowoodo, not a tree. It hides from the rain.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though it pretends to be a tree, it fails to fool even children. To the touch, its body feels more like rock than tree bark. Sudowoodo's extreme aversion to water merits special note.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
